{"4405820":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Broken Soccer","steam_appid":4405820,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[4838180],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4405820\/extras\/f73ec606f27abfd80abcd9819dee1fc9.poster.avif?t=1793681714\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4405820\/extras\/f73ec606f27abfd80abcd9819dee1fc9.webm?t=1793681714\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4405820\/extras\/f73ec606f27abfd80abcd9819dee1fc9.mp4?t=1793681714\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every match starts as soccer. None of them end that way.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhere between a bison stampede, a sheriff opening fire and Blackbeard rising from the dead, someone usually scores. Usually.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Broken Soccer is arcade 5v5 soccer with dice, curses, dirty tricks and absolutely no supervision. 38 absurd teams fight for the Broken Cup: pirates, cowboys, crypto bros, hippies, punks, pharaohs, orcs, streamers, gym bros, the Roman Empire and many more. Each one has its own stats, its own playstyle and its own way of ruining a match.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⭐ Key Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >38 playable teams, 6 powers each<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 230 powers decided by a die. Every roll is a gamble<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll a 1 and the power hits your own players<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draws aren't settled with penalties. They're settled with fists<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Broken Cup campaign: 38 matches with every team, all the way to the final boss<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival: next goal wins, one loss and you're out<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op campaign for 2–4 players<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online versus from 1v1 up to 4v4<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local play with keyboard + gamepad on the same PC<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully compatible with Steam Deck<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4405820\/extras\/95b3edcfc10cc529807ea0e0032786e2.poster.avif?t=1793681714\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4405820\/extras\/95b3edcfc10cc529807ea0e0032786e2.webm?t=1793681714\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4405820\/extras\/95b3edcfc10cc529807ea0e0032786e2.mp4?t=1793681714\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎲 One die, two outcomes: glory or humiliation<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your power bar is full, you roll.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2 to 6:<\/strong> the Great Wall of China rises in front of your goal. Your ultras jump the fence and invade the pitch. A magician hypnotizes a rival player into joining your team. The flat-earth sun comes down to burn the opposition.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1:<\/strong> your metalheads hear the neighbor's reggaeton and lose the will to live. Your grandpas poop themselves mid-sprint. Someone in your IT department deploys on a Friday, and two of your players leave the match to fix it.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Same die, same match, completely different story.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👊 No penalties. Just violence.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the match ends tied, both teams walk into an arena and settle it the old-fashioned way. Every team fights with its own weapons, and the last side standing takes the win.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚽ Simple controls, real soccer underneath<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charge your shots, time your headers, sprint, lob and tackle. Under all the chaos there's a fast, physical arcade game that rewards skill. Then the die rolls, and skill becomes a suggestion.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏆 Game Modes<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Broken Cup<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your team and play its full 38-match campaign, all the way to the final against the evil Video Game Corporations.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One goal decides every match. Lose once and it's over. Instead of dice, one neutral power affects both teams: a rugby ball with random bounces, a flooded pitch, both keepers asleep…<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Friendly &amp; Practice<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick matches, soccer practice and fighting practice.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👥 Multiplayer<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online co-op:<\/strong> play the Broken Cup with up to 4 players.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online versus:<\/strong> create public or friends-only rooms, from 1v1 to 4v4. The AI fills the empty slots.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local:<\/strong> two players on the same PC, keyboard and gamepad, in versus or co-op against the AI.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 Controls &amp; Steam Deck<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamepad recommended. Keyboard players will survive.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully compatible with Steam Deck: take the chaos anywhere.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4405820\/extras\/f73ec606f27abfd80abcd9819dee1fc9.poster.avif?t=1793681714\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4405820\/extras\/f73ec606f27abfd80abcd9819dee1fc9.webm?t=1793681714\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4405820\/extras\/f73ec606f27abfd80abcd9819dee1fc9.mp4?t=1793681714\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every match starts as soccer. None of them end that way.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhere between a bison stampede, a sheriff opening fire and Blackbeard rising from the dead, someone usually scores. Usually.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Broken Soccer is arcade 5v5 soccer with dice, curses, dirty tricks and absolutely no supervision. 38 absurd teams fight for the Broken Cup: pirates, cowboys, crypto bros, hippies, punks, pharaohs, orcs, streamers, gym bros, the Roman Empire and many more. Each one has its own stats, its own playstyle and its own way of ruining a match.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⭐ Key Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >38 playable teams, 6 powers each<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 230 powers decided by a die. Every roll is a gamble<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll a 1 and the power hits your own players<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draws aren't settled with penalties. They're settled with fists<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Broken Cup campaign: 38 matches with every team, all the way to the final boss<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival: next goal wins, one loss and you're out<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op campaign for 2–4 players<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online versus from 1v1 up to 4v4<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local play with keyboard + gamepad on the same PC<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully compatible with Steam Deck<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4405820\/extras\/95b3edcfc10cc529807ea0e0032786e2.poster.avif?t=1793681714\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4405820\/extras\/95b3edcfc10cc529807ea0e0032786e2.webm?t=1793681714\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4405820\/extras\/95b3edcfc10cc529807ea0e0032786e2.mp4?t=1793681714\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎲 One die, two outcomes: glory or humiliation<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your power bar is full, you roll.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2 to 6:<\/strong> the Great Wall of China rises in front of your goal. Your ultras jump the fence and invade the pitch. A magician hypnotizes a rival player into joining your team. The flat-earth sun comes down to burn the opposition.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1:<\/strong> your metalheads hear the neighbor's reggaeton and lose the will to live. Your grandpas poop themselves mid-sprint. Someone in your IT department deploys on a Friday, and two of your players leave the match to fix it.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Same die, same match, completely different story.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👊 No penalties. Just violence.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the match ends tied, both teams walk into an arena and settle it the old-fashioned way. Every team fights with its own weapons, and the last side standing takes the win.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚽ Simple controls, real soccer underneath<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charge your shots, time your headers, sprint, lob and tackle. Under all the chaos there's a fast, physical arcade game that rewards skill. Then the die rolls, and skill becomes a suggestion.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏆 Game Modes<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Broken Cup<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your team and play its full 38-match campaign, all the way to the final against the evil Video Game Corporations.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One goal decides every match. Lose once and it's over. Instead of dice, one neutral power affects both teams: a rugby ball with random bounces, a flooded pitch, both keepers asleep…<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Friendly &amp; Practice<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick matches, soccer practice and fighting practice.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👥 Multiplayer<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online co-op:<\/strong> play the Broken Cup with up to 4 players.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online versus:<\/strong> create public or friends-only rooms, from 1v1 to 4v4. The AI fills the empty slots.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local:<\/strong> two players on the same PC, keyboard and gamepad, in versus or co-op against the AI.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 Controls &amp; Steam Deck<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamepad recommended. Keyboard players will survive.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully compatible with Steam Deck: take the chaos anywhere.<\/p>","short_description":"Pick one of 38 ridiculous teams, roll the die and unleash a dinosaur charge, a zombie infection, a bull market (with an actual bull) or Nietzsche off the bench. Tied at full time? Boots off, fists up. Solo, co-op or online versus up to 4v4.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean, Spanish - Latin America, Greek, Hungarian, Japanese, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Thai, Turkish, Vietnamese, Arabic, Russian, Bulgarian, Czech, Danish, Finnish, Dutch, Norwegian, Romanian, Swedish, Indonesian, Malay, Ukrainian, Bosnian, Slovak, Serbian, Croatian, Filipino, Albanian, Catalan, Slovenian, Estonian, Kazakh, Latvian, Lithuanian, Macedonian, Mongolian, Tatar<br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4405820\/8bac5cd557f3bf081221202f14e4461d9c4882d6\/header.jpg?t=1793681714","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4405820\/3dbc4648a6b5bf34145bf5c57531a3837e91b0e1\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793681714","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4405820\/3dbc4648a6b5bf34145bf5c57531a3837e91b0e1\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793681714","website":"https:\/\/metalwalrus.com\/","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3-6100 \/ AMD FX-6300<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4096 MB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GT 1030 \/ AMD Radeon RX 550 (2 GB VRAM)<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 4 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> DirectX compatible<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Internet connection required for multiplayer mode<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10\/11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-8400 \/ AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8192 MB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 Ti \/ AMD Radeon RX 570 (4 GB VRAM)<br><\/li><li><str